       ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_coding_gcn_172'), 2, 'Look at the order of the calls on `g`, at the timeout passed to `Shutdown` (what is left of `GracePeriodMs`), and at what decides the exit code.'),
