       ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_quiz_gcn_181'), 2, 'Every distinct combination of label values is its own time series, stored and indexed separately. How many distinct values can a path with an order id take?'),
       ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_quiz_gcn_181'), 3, 'Look at what `logger.With(...)` returns and which log lines are written through it.');
